# Trang chủ — Section Patterns

## Order (home page flow)
1. `<Hero />` — editorial headline + breathing orb + stats.
2. `<Marquee />` — affirmation bar (GSAP infinite scroll, prefers-reduced-motion).
3. `Why Section` — 3 feature cards (RevealItem stagger).
4. `Stories Preview` — SectionHeading + StoryCard masonry.
5. `Journal Paper Demo` — interactive preview.
6. `Hugs Teaser` — night CTA.
7. `<Footer />` — đêm sao.

## Section wrapper
- `<section className="grain relative overflow-hidden">` + `aria-label`.
- `.container-page` padding.
- Decorative blur circles: `pointer-events-none absolute ... blur-3xl`.

## Reveal pattern (scroll animation)
- Import `{ Reveal, RevealItem }` từ `@/components/home/Reveal`.
- `Reveal` bọc toàn section, `RevealItem` cho từng card/list item.
- Duration ≤ 600ms, `power3.out` easing.

## SectionHeading
- Props: `index="01"`, `eyebrow`, `title`, `lead?`, `align="left|center"`.
- eyebrow format: `<span className="font-display text-clay tabular-nums">{index}</span> {eyebrow}`.
- Title: `text-balance font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold`.

## Spacing convention
- `py-20 md:py-28` cho section.
- `py-16 md:py-20` cho subsections.